{
	"_about": "Creature species as data records, read by sim/AssetLibrary.cs. Adding a creature is adding a record. sprite: from assets/sprites/. speed: tiles per second. roam: how far (tiles) it wanders. natural: the biomes (names from scripts/world/biomes.gd) where it is born on its own, with a weight: in each biome, species are drawn in proportion to their weights. A species with no natural biome never appears by itself: only the player (god powers) or events bring it. Monsters live in special biomes, which only the player creates, so a fresh world never has monsters. diet: herbivore (grazes the grass of its tile), carnivore (hunts creatures of its size or smaller), omnivore (both), none (never eats: undead, golems). size: 0-12, a hunter only catches prey of its size or smaller. lifespan: years (a year lasts 60 s). litter: young per birth (0: does not breed). migrates: moves towards the equator in winter.",
